{"id":"45ddb0364081e108","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/007_经典一阶逻辑_FOL.md","title":"007 经典一阶逻辑 FOL","display":"007_经典一阶逻辑_FOL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F},\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F},\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal R=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F}:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}:\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal R=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F}:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}:\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{fun},\\operatorname{rel},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{fun},\\operatorname{rel},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>构造子名字集合记为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctor}_{FOL}=\\{\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{fun},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ctor}_{FOL}=\\{\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{fun},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标特征数据定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Feature}_{FOL}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal R,\n\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R},\n\\operatorname{rel},\n\\operatorname{all}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Feature}_{FOL}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal R,\n\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R},\n\\operatorname{rel},\n\\operatorname{all}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该数据记录关系原子和全称量词构造；本文件的原始构造子集合不包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}\">\\(\\operatorname{eq}\\)</span>，原子公式形成子句只由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\)</span> 给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项\">2. 项</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F}(f)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F}(f)=n\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-公式\">3. 公式</h1>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"4.-自由变量与绑定变量\">4. 自由变量与绑定变量</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau))\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\tau(i))\n\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F}(f)=n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau))\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\tau(i))\n\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F}(f)=n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。公式自由变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\tau(i))\n\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(\\tau(i))\n\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\)</span> 由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\operatorname{all}(x,A))\n=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-替换\">5. 替换</h1>\n<p>项替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}:\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}:\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau&#39;)\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=s]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau&#39;)\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=s]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。公式替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;)\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=s],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;)\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=s],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[x:=s]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\operatorname{all}(y,A)\">\\(C=\\operatorname{all}(y,A)\\)</span>，则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=C\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=C\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=\\operatorname{all}(y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=\\operatorname{all}(y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\">\\(y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=\\operatorname{all}(z,(A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=\\operatorname{all}(z,(A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-$\\alpha$-等价\">6. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{FOL}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{FOL}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的二元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交集。</p>\n<p>第一，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</p>\n<p>第二，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 对构造子相容：</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0)\\in E\\land(A_1,B_1)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n(\\operatorname{imp}(A_0,A_1),\\operatorname{imp}(B_0,B_1))\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A_0,B_0)\\in E\\land(A_1,B_1)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n(\\operatorname{imp}(A_0,A_1),\\operatorname{imp}(B_0,B_1))\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\\land x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\n\\Rightarrow\n(\\operatorname{all}(x,A),\\operatorname{all}(x,B))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in E\\land x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\n\\Rightarrow\n(\\operatorname{all}(x,A),\\operatorname{all}(x,B))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第三，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 包含全部捕获避免绑定改名生成对。若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{all}(x,A),\\operatorname{all}(y,A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\operatorname{all}(x,A),\\operatorname{all}(y,A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)]))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系原子没有绑定位置，因此没有额外的原子改名生成对。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-公理集合\">7. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\to A[x:=t]:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\to A[x:=t]:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\operatorname{all}(x,B)):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\\\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{all}(x,A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\operatorname{all}(x,B)):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\\\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-规则与证明\">8. 规则与证明</h1>\n<p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{FOL}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{FOL}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{FOL}\n=\n\\{((A),\\operatorname{all}(x,A)):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{FOL}\n=\n\\{((A),\\operatorname{all}(x,A)):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{FOL}\n=\n\\{((A),B):A\\equiv_\\alpha^{FOL}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{FOL}\n=\n\\{((A),B):A\\equiv_\\alpha^{FOL}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{FOL}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{FOL}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{FOL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{FOL}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{FOL}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{FOL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 出发的证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span> 满足下列一种条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\\in\\Gamma\">\\(p(k)\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j&lt;k\">\\(i,j&lt;k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(j)=A\\to B\">\\(p(j)=A\\to B\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=B\">\\(p(k)=B\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\">\\(p(k)=\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(C)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(C)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)\\equiv_\\alpha^{FOL}p(k)\">\\(p(i)\\equiv_\\alpha^{FOL}p(k)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}(\\Gamma,p,k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}(\\Gamma,p,k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span>，并且上列 1--5 中至少一项成立。定义证明对象集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}:n&gt;0\\land\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}(\\Gamma,p,k)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}:n&gt;0\\land\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}(\\Gamma,p,k)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-可证性与整个形式系统\">9. 可证性与整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}(\\Gamma)\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\">\\(p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(n-1)=A\">\\(p(n-1)=A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义目标差异谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{FOL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{FOL}\n=(\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{all})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{eq}\\notin\\mathsf{Ctor}_{FOL}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\,\n\\forall A\\,\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}A\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{FOL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{FOL}\n=(\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{all})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{eq}\\notin\\mathsf{Ctor}_{FOL}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\,\n\\forall A\\,\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}A\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Var},\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{FOL},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{FOL},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{FOL},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{FOL},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\vdash_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{FOL},\n\\Delta_{FOL}\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Var},\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{FOL},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{FOL},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{FOL},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{FOL},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\vdash_{FOL}^{\\Sigma},\n\\mathsf{Feature}_{FOL},\n\\Delta_{FOL}\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含无等号一阶句法、替换、公理、规则、证明对象、证明关系和目标差异对象；不含等号、结构、解释、满足或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-项","text":"2. 项","level":1},{"id":"3.-公式","text":"3. 公式","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由变量与绑定变量","text":"4. 自由变量与绑定变量","level":1},{"id":"5.-替换","text":"5. 替换","level":1},{"id":"6.-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"6. $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"7.-公理集合","text":"7. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"8.-规则与证明","text":"8. 规则与证明","level":1},{"id":"9.-可证性与整个形式系统","text":"9. 可证性与整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal R,\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F},\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal R=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F}:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}:\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_m,","display":true},{"tex":"m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{fun},\\operatorname{rel},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctor}_{FOL}=\\{\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{fun},\\operatorname{rel},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Feature}_{FOL}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal R,\n\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R},\n\\operatorname{rel},\n\\operatorname{all}\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{eq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal F}(f)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fun}(f,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathcal R}(R)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{FOL}^{\\Sigma}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operator